# Manual Content Mode

Manual Content Mode applies when CTO provides exact file contents.

When Manual Content Mode is active, do not rewrite the content.

Do not summarize the content.

Do not optimize the content.

Do not compress the content.

Do not merge lines together.

Do not convert files into single-line content.

Write the provided content exactly to the specified path.

Preserve line breaks.

Preserve indentation.

Preserve normal Markdown formatting.

Preserve normal Python formatting.

After writing files, run the requested validation commands.

If validation fails, report the failure instead of guessing a fix.

Manual Content Mode is used to prevent file format corruption.
